'''George Anthony Visger''' (born September 26, 1958) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[defensive tackle]] for the [[San Francisco 49ers]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Colorado Buffaloes football|Colorado Buffaloes]].<ref>[https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/V/VisgGe20.htm George Visger NFL & AFL Football Statistics - Pro-Football-Reference.com]</ref>
